  "story": {
    "text": "Laurie lingers in Nice, {IDLING} about with Amy and doing nothing. One day she {SKETCHES} him lying on the turf, then gives him a {LECTURE}: he is {LAZY} and {SELFISH}, and wasting his life. Stung, Laurie leaves for his grandfather’s side, {DETERMINED} to do better.",
